      propertyPath: description
      value: This will insert the first ticket you have from your pocket to the distributor.\n\nIf
        you don't have any ticket in your inventory, then this does nothing.\n\nThis
        is for people that are very very in a hurry and can't drag & drop their ticket
        with mouse/controller.\n\nThis description is very long !! I hope you enjoy
        your journey little person :D\n\n/l*tap tap on the head*
